# C# Conventions

Follow `CONVENTIONS.md` and `AGENTS.md`.

- Use async/await; propagate `CancellationToken`.
- XML documentation on public API members.
- `JsonPropertyName` on serialised model properties.
- Register `AcmeClient` via `AddAcmeClient`; do not `new HttpClient()` inside the library.
- Do not log secrets or API keys.
